REALREVISE 0.12
id refine-full
claim_scope burden-revision
source_ontology V1
target_ontology V2
source_burden A q1+q2 DEBT
target_burden A1 q1
target_burden A2 q2
map A REFINE A1+A2 MIXED
target_cover A1+A2
debt_trace A A1
debt_trace A A2
debt_count_mode SOURCE_ANCESTRY
witness_future_burden NONE
authorize_debt_complete YES
authorize_merge_preserved YES
authorize_path_conflict NO
authorize_arbitration NO
authorize_same_label_drift NO
END
